.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E5%90%8D%E8%80%85\" title=\"无名者\"><img alt=\"无名者\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-314701.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/22/HeadIconSmall-314701.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%97%A0%E5%90%8D%E8%80%85\" title=\"无名者\">无名者</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.9</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>梅尔特米晴风</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：314704</div></div></div></div><div class=\"skin-video tabber\"><h2><span id=\".E8.A7.86.E9.A2.91.E9.A2.84.E8.A7.88\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"视频预览\">视频预览</span></h2><div class=\"tabber-filter\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 4px -3px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button selected\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"4\">1技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"3\">2技能</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"2\">大招</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"videoId\" data-videoid=\"1\">入场</div></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"4\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者skill1.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者born.mp4_20260811_162444.542.png\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"3\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者skill2.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者born.mp4_20260811_162444.542.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"2\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者unique.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者born.mp4_20260811_162444.542.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div><div class=\"skin-video--single tabber-item\" data-videoid=\"1\" data-videourl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者born.mp4\" data-backgroundurl=\"https&#58;//notice-res.sl916.com/skinVideo/50001/3147/314704/无名者born.mp4_20260811_162444.542.png\" style=\"display:none\"></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">你应当是流动的。<br />这是水下舞蹈的要义，她贯彻得不算完美——训练成就了周密，也磨损了原本随波摇曳的灵动。但她对身体的精确控制填补了短板：优秀的间谍时刻保证自我如液体般柔软可塑。<br />定点，动作，将每处细节逐一铭刻进躯体，再饰以一点微笑——哦，这可不是需要遵循“探戈不得微笑”那种传统规定的场合。起源于情人与秘密的舞蹈呵，变奏的舞步如锋刃贴肤，前者吸引目标，后者截获目标，节拍掌控着所有观者的梦与醒，chan chan！<br />再多一点翩跹、再多一分莫测……毕竟千般可变的介质，最适宜装扮与充填。只是——<br />技艺卓绝的表演者啊，当你望向水影之时，又为何长久出神？</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"314704\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f1/Belonging-314704.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“一瞬的光彩”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Fleeting Radiance\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />300<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由珍珠与草叶制成的一弯头饰。<br />它的光泽柔美而脆弱，其上的几颗珍珠因长时间的海水浸泡而变得有些黯淡。或许对一场表演而言，这样的缺损无关紧要——并非每位观众都会在乎一场华丽演出中的小小裂痕。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6b/Belonging-314705.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“恒我”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Constancy of Self\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />180<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一握绿意横生的花杖，主要用于增强水下表演效果，如制造气泡、扬洒花瓣等。<br />此外，这一握花杖也有在水中帮助表演者调整姿态、保持平衡的辅助效果，对受访者来说，似乎还存在某些关于“自我”“统一性”等命题的特殊意义。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-314706.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/c2/Belonging-314706.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“地中海的裙摆”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"The Hem of the Mediterranean Sea\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一条缀有贝母与螺钿的披帛，由水精灵们使用特殊的梭织工艺制成。<br />绡纱上的幻光摄人心魄，似乎附有水精灵们的神秘术。在“那场至关重要的演出”中，它让观众席上的目标短暂失神，为受访者争取到了获得关键情报的契机。</div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"全新语音\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.85.A8.E6.96.B0.E8.AF.AD.E9.9F.B3_New_Voice\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"全新语音_New_Voice\">全新语音<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">New Voice</span></small></span></h2><div><table class=\"wikitable responsive voice-table zh-only\" style=\"margin:0; --size: 23px; width:100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"hide-m\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><td style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"Tupo xindiantu.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/107px-Tupo_xindiantu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"107\" height=\"30\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/161px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/Tupo_xindiantu.png/214px-Tupo_xindiantu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"740\" data-file-height=\"208\" /></td><th>EN</th><th>中</th><th class=\"not-zh\">日</th><th class=\"not-zh\">한</th><th>文本</th></tr><tr><th>袖与手</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero314704_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_71\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314704_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_71\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314704_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_71\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">한 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314704_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_71\"></i></span></td><td class=\"hide-m\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314704_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_71\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314704_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_71\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314704_mainvoc_71.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_71\"></i></td><td>观众赠予我这束鲜花的那一刻，我会一直记得……真诚的泪水、热烈的掌声都在那一瞬化为我心底的感动。<div class=\"grey-small\">I'll always remember the moment they gave me this bouquet of flowers … Their tears and applause made me realize that there is, in fact, a softness in my heart. </div></td></tr><tr><th>闲谈Ⅰ</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero314704_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_72\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314704_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_72\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314704_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_72\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">한 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314704_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_72\"></i></span></td><td class=\"hide-m\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314704_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_72\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314704_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_72\"></i></td><td class=\"hide-m not-zh\"><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314704_mainvoc_72.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_mainvoc_72\"></i></td><td>飞蛾与花朵都非海中之物，水精灵自然很好奇这些。我已摆脱过往的名字——摆脱曾经的命运。那么，我也会遇见未见过的花朵吗？<div class=\"grey-small\">See how curious the water spirits are? There aren't any flowers like these in the ocean. I wonder ... with the cocoon of my past now shed, will I ever see a flower with new eyes, like them? </div></td></tr><tr><th>入队</th><td><span class=\"hide-pc\">EN </span><i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"En_play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55\"></i><i class=\"hide-pc\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc\">中 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Zh_play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">日 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Jp_play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55\"></i></span><i class=\"hide-pc not-zh\" style=\"margin:10px;\"><i class=\"verticalline\"></i></i><span class=\"hide-pc not-zh\">한 <i class=\"audio-control style1\" data-audio=\"Kr_play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55.mp3\" title=\"play_hero314704_fightingvoc_55\"></i></span></td><